From: Evgeny Voropaev <evorop@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 20:57:33 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Pass source relation conversion metadata through PG19
 database copy reads

Adapt supplied0014 while preserving PG19 read-stream batching, callbacks and worker configuration. Copy relation kind and freeze horizons from source pg_class through per-operation and shared AIO value fields, without backend-private pointers. Register a distinct TAP number because PG19 already has test 008. CREATE DATABASE coverage passes against PG15.19 using sync/worker and WAL_LOG/FILE_COPY paths.
